                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Capable of being modelled."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e06a8c7a-6f10-422a-8989-0918a482fda2",
                                                "sense_id": "498dcb0a-8650-336f-81b2-b55d3d5ea1e0",
                                                "text": "features not modellable as a service, but rather as a service attribute"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "af5f493f-415d-3a0f-b5cd-12888f0d0b06",
                                        "entry_id": "470c5b16-bb43-39ad-ba44-0fcd48f1c5ba",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Capable of being moulded."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0c455f6d-fac9-4008-a42b-e9c8bc21ee4e",
                                                "sense_id": "af5f493f-415d-3a0f-b5cd-12888f0d0b06",
                                                "text": "[…] applying to at least part of the bottom of the mold cavity in said drag a coating of substantial thickness of a translucent, modellable plastic mass comprising finely divided acrylate moistened with a volatile liquid that is a non-solvent of acrylate and contains only a small quantity of an acrylate solvent,"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2c6cc8ce-d222-4505-83bc-3c3c2528c582",
                                                "sense_id": "af5f493f-415d-3a0f-b5cd-12888f0d0b06",
                                                "text": "Usage and handling will soon indicate if the clay is modellable, and if it is highly plastic."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "04e47c1a-2660-4fa7-b252-ad068d20c467",
                                                "sense_id": "af5f493f-415d-3a0f-b5cd-12888f0d0b06",
                                                "text": "For about 10 years, following the suggestion of Gluck who, as is well known, has used ivory for replacement of bony defects of the jaws and extremities, I have also used this very modellable material for correcting saddle noses and for total rhinoneoplasty usually with very good results."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
